          "short": "$-50$\n\nThere are 25 adjacent pairs, each with sum $-2$.",
          "worked": "There are 50 odd-number terms from 1 to 99, forming 25 adjacent pairs. Each pair has sum $-2$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}1-3+\\cdots+97-99&=(1-3)+(5-7)+\\cdots+(97-99)\\\\1-3+\\cdots+97-99&=25\\times(-2)\\\\1-3+\\cdots+97-99&=-50\\end{align*}$$",
